{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/extras/d8d35fa483bd26057ff03fddc4968a46.avif?t=1768534980\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/extras_big/d8d35fa483bd26057ff03fddc4968a46.avif?t=1768534980 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witch Play House</strong>\u00a0is an unconventional fantasy collection-adventure game that seamlessly blends exhilarating monster-slaying action with a deep collection system. The game features a unique &quot;aesthetic of feet&quot; theme, creating a mysterious world brimming with whimsical imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/extras/00adfe0e0280d71d066d66e9c748d347.avif?t=1768534980\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/extras_big/00adfe0e0280d71d066d66e9c748d347.avif?t=1768534980 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Pick Up, Hard to Put Down</strong><br>Simple and intuitive gameplay with a low skill ceiling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/extras/263adc3f331457c1b7cec498fd764be3.avif?t=1768534980\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/extras_big/263adc3f331457c1b7cec498fd764be3.avif?t=1768534980 width=800 height=450 /></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Collection Elements</strong><br>Hundreds of stylish outfits, accessories, and bizarre artifacts await discovery, along with exclusive character story illustrations to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/extras/5289bc75d43efe600d31274c85b31946.avif?t=1768534980\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/extras_big/5289bc75d43efe600d31274c85b31946.avif?t=1768534980 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Visual Experience</strong><br>An unusual art style\u2014from monsters to environments, everything is filled with unexpected designs, where you\u2019ll encounter fantastical creatures beyond imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/extras/d38948dcf27b209cae09f6ec5a5b991d.avif?t=1768534980\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764490/extras_big/d38948dcf27b209cae09f6ec5a5b991d.avif?t=1768534980 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Affinity System</strong><br>Build relationships to unlock character-specific storylines, each with their own bizarre and intriguing tales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no ordinary RPG!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Insider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3764490/62129600906c31028453c6d2eea7cf660fba9827.jpg"},{"name":"Rookie Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3764490/ea12c5010914658d080c6bea8f970bc2a3dc40d4.jpg"},{"name":"On A Roll","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3764490/c412d7a72498e03cab0c79b133bbc6dea08ba17e.jpg"},{"name":"Century of Carnage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3764490/f0ccbbb35fc8ad2fbd57c40327019d62f82636fc.jpg"},{"name":"Legion's Bane","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3764490/d4d7320